markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Teaching About AI

#### A lot of the content we've covered so far in this Module has focused on teaching **with AI**.

<div style="text-align:center;">
  <img 
    src="https://images.code.org/b83679a5c60b1c90831a4b35461b5103-Screenshot 2026-03-11 at 1.06.25 PM.png" 
    alt="Potential benefits and risks of AI in education."
    style="width:75%; max-width:100%; height:auto;"
  >
</div>

*Image: TeachAI*

#### Teaching with AI and teaching about AI are closely connected and often happen at the same time.

#### When you use AI as part of your teaching practice, you naturally create opportunities for students to ask questions about how it works, what it produces, and whether it can be trusted.

#### However, sometimes you'll want to also teach more explicitly **about AI**. For the remainder of this module we'll focus on teaching about AI.

