</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🔬</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Exploring how AI systems are built</strong> through models, datasets, and simple simulations
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧑‍⚖️</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Analyzing societal and ethical impacts</strong> such as bias, privacy, fairness, and misinformation
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🌍</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Connecting AI to disciplines</strong> like computer science, data science, mathematics, science, and social studies
</div></div>

